    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "s125x",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1480,
      "name": "Note A",
      "width": 520,
      "height": 360,
      "content": "Split A — list and summary\n\nOne window replaces the list plus the floating summary panel. List column 340 pt (resizable 280–420), 32 pt one-line rows: time, title, status. Duration moves to the detail header. The detail shows the selected call's summary as rendered Markdown; Копировать copies its source; ⋯ holds Открыть в Finder, Переименовать, Повторить итоги, Удалить….\n\n↑↓ in the list updates the detail at once; Tab moves focus into the detail for selection and copying. A call without a summary shows its status in the detail (preparing, failed with Повторить).\n\nOpen: whether the transcript is reachable from here at all; the minimum width (list 280 + detail 420 = 700)."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "s126x",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 1480,
      "name": "Note B",
      "width": 520,
      "height": 360,
      "content": "Split B — rows with gist, transcript tab\n\nMail-style two-line rows: title and time, then duration and a one-line gist (the first sentence of «О чём встреча»; «Подготовка итогов…» or a red «Не удалось…» otherwise). Rows are taller (~48 pt), so fewer calls fit, but a call is recognisable without opening it.\n\nThe detail toolbar has Итоги | Транскрипт (⌘1, ⌘2). The transcript shows each line's time and speaker in `them`/`me` colours; a timestamp in the summary ([04:41]) jumps to the transcript at that line.\n\nOpen: where the gist comes from (a separate field in summary.md, or its first sentence); whether search matches open the transcript tab at the hit."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "s127x",
      "x": 2360,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Note common",
      "width": 440,
      "height": 480,
      "content": "Common to both\n\n• Narrow window: below 700 pt the detail hides and the list fills the window; Return or double-click opens the summary in its own window (today's panel).\n• Each split has a visible divider; its position is kept across restarts.\n• Search stays above the list and filters it; the detail follows the selection.\n• Inactive window: selection turns `chip`, as in the current list.\n\nNot drawn yet: empty selection («Выберите звонок»), no-summary states in the detail, search, narrow width."
    }
  ],
